  "initialization_order": [
    "Keep ROW_ARM_N high/input; no output arm during ROM or download.",
    "Initialize I2C_INT and MCU row GPIOs as inputs; satisfy 3ms strap hold.",
    "Drive ROW_ARM_N low open-drain; this releases expander reset and enables row supply, while gate defaults keep all rows disconnected.",
    "Verify CONFIG=FF/FF; write POLARITY=00/00 and OUTPUT=55/55 to U40/U41, FF/FF to U42.",
    "Only then write CONFIG=00/00; all rows remain Hi-Z.",
    "On NACK/error/shutdown release ROW_ARM_N high/input. Before each mode transition open ISO_N, remove old PG/NG drive, then apply new mode."
  ],
